  "engineV3": {
    "_comment": "Engine v3 routes per role, best first ('provider:model'). Quality tiers: art/design/vision are 'strong' roles — Gemini Flash first (main designer), then the strongest free no-card models (Mistral Large 4 / GLM-5.3 on Mistral Free mode, DeepSeek-V3.1 / gpt-oss-120b on SambaNova free), then NVIDIA (only with ALLOW_NVIDIA_PRODUCTION=true), OpenRouter free, Gemma 4, Groq, Cloudflare; a model marked tier 'fast' is never used there. brief/research/outline are 'light' roles — fast models first (Groq gpt-oss-120b, Mistral Small) so the Gemini quota is kept for design. Every provider is optional: no key = skipped. A 429 or a used-up daily quota moves to the next route at once; a provider failing 3x in a row is benched for 5 min. Override at runtime with ENGINE_V3_ROUTES (same shape as 'roles'). Checked 31 Oct 2026: Cerebras (needs a card) and GitHub Models (retired 30 Jul 2026) are not used.",
